s(t, true)` for interactive, `simulateTerminals(t, false)` for non-interactive (line 10, usage at e.g. 296, 405).\n- **Stdin scripting**: Pass a `stdin` string to `runRoast`; each `\\n` is a line answer. Custom endpoint prompts need 5 lines (endpoint, protocol, key var, model, then next provider+model).\n- **Trust assertion**: Load config with `loadConfig(file)`, compute `trustProjection(cfg)`, check `requiresApproval(p)`, compute `trustHash(p)`, then `await isApproved(repo.dir, hash, { env:repo.env as NodeJS.ProcessEnv })` returns `'approved'`|`'not-approved'`.\n- **Config assertion**: `loadConfig(file)` then `resolveRole(cfg, 'finder'|'verifier', envObj)` checks model, baseURL, protocol, apiKey, credential.env.\n- Tests don't use `initLoginRepo` for `--no-login` tests; they set up `tempRepo()` + `simulateTerminals()` directly.","usage":{"total_tokens":71677,"tool_uses":2,"duration_ms":28723},"uuid":"8a72b52c-84b6-4068-b1a1-8fac5249c2ef","session_id":"d5fff85d-1c72-432c-ba87-5f843ff95960"}
